            "level": {
              "value": 1
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "Your supernatural connection sometimes causes you to phase from reality when under threat, disappearing for split seconds before reappearing\u2014often surprising you as much as your enemies. Roll a DC 16 flat check. On a success, you gain resistance to all damage equal to your level against the triggering effect, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to saving throws against that effect until the start of your turn, and you gain the dazzled condition for 1 round."
            }
          }
        }
